{"id":"reference/Zig-Standard-Library","kind":"langref","title":"Zig 标准库","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Zig-Standard-Library","file":"reference/Zig-Standard-Library.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Zig-Standard-Library","text":"Zig 标准库"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Zig-Standard-Library\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zig-Standard-Library/#Zig-Standard-Library\">Zig 标准库</a></h2>\n\n      <p><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/\">Zig 标准库</a>有独立的文档。</p>\n      <p>Zig 标准库包含常用算法、数据结构及相关定义，帮助你构建程序或库。本文档中有许多使用 Zig 标准库的示例。如需进一步了解 Zig 标准库，请访问上面的链接。</p>\n      <p>此外，每份 Zig 发行包都附带标准库文档。可以通过以下命令启动本地 Web 服务器来查看：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>zig std\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      \n\n      ","translation":{"total":5,"translated":5}}
